				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:22" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>このメダルを　イチオシに　登録し
他の　プレイヤーに　公開します</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:22" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:22" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>イチオシ登録時
メッセージウィンドウ</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:22" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>256</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:22" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
